  "notes": "Honey/bee brand: amber (#ffb800-ish) used sparingly for the selected tab text/icon, the Select button and the active Preferences rail item (pale amber 18px-radius tile); tab highlight is a pale cream fill. Settings rows are label + gray description on the left, control on the right, separated by hairline dividers inside #f4f4f4 rounded (10px) panels; standalone settings get their own panel. Content column is a fixed 720px centered in the remaining space, leaving wide empty margins. Rail icons are 48px rounded squares with tiny captions underneath; bottom icons are icon-only with hover tooltips. Switch off-state is a faint peach track. Long filesystem paths are ellipsized. Other tabs (e.g. Metadata) use segmented controls and blue switches."
